# Project conventions

This project is specified in PLAN.md. When working on any task, 
first read the relevant section(s) of PLAN.md and follow the 
specification exactly.

## Hard rules
- TypeScript everywhere, strict mode on
- Never add fields, endpoints, or features not specified in PLAN.md
- Never use localStorage or browser storage; use AsyncStorage 
  (React Native) or Supabase (backend)
- Every external integration (Sleeper, ESPN, streaming services) 
  must be hidden behind an interface — see PLAN.md Section 2 
  "Swap-ready architecture principle"
- Write tests alongside implementation, not after
- Prefer Fastify plugins over middleware

## When unsure
Reference the section number in PLAN.md and ask before deviating.
Don't gold-plate. Don't add "helpful" features I didn't ask for.

## File layout (see PLAN.md Appendix)
- services/ingestion/  — ESPN consumer
- services/engine/     — switching engine  
- services/dispatcher/ — deferred event firing
- services/api/        — REST + WebSocket
- app/screens/         — iOS screens
- app/playback/        — PlaybackSource implementations
- shared/types/        — shared TS types